 "caveat": "the window is placed as drawn, on the floor, with at most two rows above it; a terrain holds no T and at most twelve pieces, because the planner deals the stood T and the follow-up T from two consecutive bags. A board this search does not find is not a board that cannot be built.",
 "rules": [
  "every board is built from an empty board by pieces out of a 7-bag, no line cleared before the stood T",
